			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.design/@setstudio\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>setstudio</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://bell.bz/@andy\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>andy</span></a></span> Well, my screen size is 1920x1080, but let me open dev tools so I can see what my viewport size is…</p><p>Oops, sorry, now it is 1418x892 with dev tools open. Let me close dev tools and see if I can find a screen ruler to measure. Ok, I'm just going to split screen this window so I can find the ruler…</p><p>Oh, now the ideal viewport is 940×979 at half screen…</p><p>Maybe I should build my own site that auto-publishes my viewport so everyone can keep up?</p>",
